---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="How We Work — bbd.sh"
  description="bbd.sh's approach: validate the business, then ship the product. A 4-step delivery process, modern AI tooling, and flexible terms that suit founders, operators, and VCs."
>
  <section class="border-b border-ink/10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted mb-2">## workflow.md</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight mb-8">
        How we work
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-ink/75 leading-relaxed mb-12">
        We work with founders, operators, and VCs across the full lifecycle —
        from validating the business model, through brand and product, to launch and growth.
        Any digital product with a real business behind it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-ink/10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 prose prose-lg">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold mb-6">What we offer</h2>
      <p class="text-ink/75 mb-8">
        End-to-end incubation. Pick the slice you need, or all of it:
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 not-prose font-mono text-sm mb-12">
        {[
          ['Validate the model', 'pressure-test the idea, ICP, pricing, GTM before code is written'],
          ['Brand & strategy', 'name, positioning, identity, narrative, launch plan'],
          ['Build & ship', 'full-stack engineering + AI integration end-to-end'],
          ['Growth & ops', 'SEO, analytics, lifecycle, hand-off when ready · AEO via citebeam.bbd.sh'],
        ].map(([cat, desc]) => (
          <div class="border border-electric/40 bg-electric/5 p-4">
            <p class="text-ink font-bold mb-1">{cat}</p>
            <p class="text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">{desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Product shapes we build</h3>
      <p class="text-ink/75 mb-8">
        Strong full-stack engineering plus AI tooling — covers most digital product types:
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 not-prose font-mono text-sm">
        {[
          ['SaaS / tools', 'B2B, B2C, vertical'],
          ['AI agents / copilots', 'support, sales, research, writing — any vertical'],
          ['Browser & desktop apps', 'Chrome / Edge / Electron / Tauri'],
          ['Mobile', 'React Native / Flutter / native'],
          ['Content & media', 'blogs, newsletters, small communities'],
          ['Ecommerce / standalone storefronts', 'Shopify / custom / cross-border'],
          ['Dev tools / API services', 'CLIs, SDKs, API-as-a-service'],
          ['Web3 / crypto', 'dApp frontends, contract integration (on request)'],
        ].map(([cat, desc]) => (
          <div class="border-l-2 border-electric pl-4">
            <p class="text-ink font-bold mb-1">{cat}</p>
            <p class="text-muted text-xs">{desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-ink/10 bg-graphite text-paper">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold mb-12">Stack &amp; tools</h2>
      <p class="text-paper/70 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
        We're not religious about the stack — but we lean on "less is more."
        We pick what fits each project. These are our defaults:
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-8 font-mono text-sm">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-electric mb-3">## frontend</h3>
          <p class="text-paper/80 leading-relaxed">
            Astro (content) · Next.js (product) · SvelteKit (prototypes) · Tailwind · shadcn/ui · v0 / Cursor for speed
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-electric mb-3">## backend</h3>
          <p class="text-paper/80 leading-relaxed">
            FastAPI / Hono / Bun · PostgreSQL + pgvector · Redis · Drizzle ORM · Cloudflare Workers / Edge functions
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-electric mb-3">## ai stack</h3>
          <p class="text-paper/80 leading-relaxed">
            OpenAI GPT-5 · Anthropic Claude 4.7 · DeepSeek V4 · LangGraph · MCP · custom RAG · LoRA fine-tuning · multi-model routing
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-electric mb-3">## devops</h3>
          <p class="text-paper/80 leading-relaxed">
            Cloudflare Pages · Vercel · Fly.io · Docker · GitHub Actions · Sentry · PostHog
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-electric mb-3">## design</h3>
          <p class="text-paper/80 leading-relaxed">
            Figma · Midjourney + Flux · in-house brand kit
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-ink/10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Engagement (open)</h2>
      <p class="text-ink/70 mb-12 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        We don't have a fixed deal template. Each engagement is structured around the situation —
        founders, operators, and VCs all welcome.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-6 font-mono text-sm">
        <div class="border border-ink/10 p-6">
          <p class="text-electric mb-2">option A · build cost</p>
          <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
            One-time fee scoped to the project. After delivery the product is yours, we step out.
            <span class="text-muted">// for founders or VCs with capital who want full control</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-ink/10 p-6">
          <p class="text-electric mb-2">option B · build cost + revenue share</p>
          <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
            Lower upfront cost in exchange for a revenue split after launch.
            <span class="text-muted">// for tight cash + high conviction on both sides</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-ink/10 p-6">
          <p class="text-electric mb-2">option C · equity / co-build</p>
          <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
            We take meaningful equity and build alongside you as a founding team.
            <span class="text-muted">// for high-conviction situations where we'd back the idea ourselves</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-ink/10 p-6">
          <p class="text-electric mb-2">option D · ongoing partnership</p>
          <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
            Long-term build &amp; growth. Milestone- or earn-out-based, structure flexible.
            <span class="text-muted">// for products that need continued iteration, or VC portcos needing an embedded build team</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-12 font-display text-2xl italic text-ink/70 max-w-2xl">
        "Best fit: founders or partners with capital and conviction.
        But the deal shape follows the situation, not the other way around."
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-ink text-paper">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-8">
        Ready to talk about your idea?
      </h2>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-electric text-ink hover:bg-paper transition-colors rounded font-mono font-bold"
      >
        $ ./let-us-talk →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
